{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10524","headline":"奉酬睢阳路太守见赠之作 · 高适","name":"奉酬睢阳路太守见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛才膺命代，高价动良时。\n帝简登藩翰，人和发咏思。\n神仙去华省，鵷鹭忆丹墀。\n清净能无事，优游即赋诗。\n江山纷想像，云物共萎蕤。\n逸气刘公干，玄言向子期。\n多慙汲引速，翻愧激昂迟。\n相马知何限，登龙反自疑。\n风尘吏道迫，行迈旅心悲。\n拙疾徒爲尔，穷愁欲问谁。\n秋庭一片叶，朝镜数茎丝。\n州县甘无取，丘园悔莫追。\n琼瑶生箧笥，光景借茅茨。\n他日青霄里，犹应访所知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}